{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/f55f3ee878065a5028d36ad7135dc28b.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success starts with a name! Cargo Simulator allows you to create and grow your own brand - give your warehouse a name, boost your reputation and make a difference in the logistics world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch and become the region's most powerful logistics center!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/f0b07639bef5416bd039a6de2a515304.poster.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/f0b07639bef5416bd039a6de2a515304.webm?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/f0b07639bef5416bd039a6de2a515304.mp4?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/03000daa1c861e8dace28206cabfc677.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warehouse is not just a workplace, it is a reflection of you. It's up to you to personalize your warehouse for a better working environment. Whether you want to create a modern center or a cozy family business - the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/c6a2208886dc0ea46db1cdb463d90793.poster.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/c6a2208886dc0ea46db1cdb463d90793.webm?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/c6a2208886dc0ea46db1cdb463d90793.mp4?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/2c85563825fa378ba05cd0936b3a4ee8.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, dream big! Deliver cargo on time, increase customer satisfaction and have a larger logistics network.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/1a52e626c950f97328910473fc6c3131.poster.avif?t=1759256821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/1a52e626c950f97328910473fc6c3131.webm?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/1a52e626c950f97328910473fc6c3131.mp4?t=1759256821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573430/extras/d9ba33446b